WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:04.680
Watch and read: For your labels practice, choose a describing word for the mango.

00:00:05.533 --> 00:00:09.907
The answer is: yellow. A describing word tells us more about an object.

00:00:10.783 --> 00:00:15.925
Watch and read: Ama asks: Ama feels happy. Which sentence expresses the feeling?

00:00:16.783 --> 00:00:20.943
The answer is: I feel happy.. A sentence can name a person’s feelings.
